step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple best_single strategy using the clear seasonality champion, NaiveSeasonal, to see if a single strong model outperforms the pool mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"NaiveSeasonal"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over all models to see if robust aggregation improves over best single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over the most stable five models (pool1) to see if it beats the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a deterministic Bayesian aggregation on pool2 to see if it improves over best single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a robust median over the more diverse pool2 to see if it beats best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the larger, more diverse pool3 to see if it beats the current best single NaiveSeasonal.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over the larger, more diverse pool3 to see if it can beat the current best single NaiveSeasonal.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test the best single model from the pool (rf) to see if it beats NaiveSeasonal.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if it beats the current best single NaiveSeasonal.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the larger diverse pool3 using inverse-error weights to see if it can beat the current best single NaiveSeasonal.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","rf","FT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test best_single ETS to see if it outperforms NaiveSeasonal as a single model candidate.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the larger, diverse pool4 to see if it can beat the current best single NaiveSeasonal.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

